# Master solver dependencies. Generated by tools/migrate/import_master.py from
# the CSCTF source repo's requirements.txt (pins kept, duplicate pins listed once), plus the
# test runner and the Unicorn pin B-240 asks for. Lock: requirements.lock.txt (CSCTF).
# This is the one file to edit (R-14). Every line is an exact pin (name==version). After editing, run
#   .venv/bin/python tools/requirements_gen.py
# which writes requirements.txt (the file setup.sh installs) with every pin here.

# System tools (ghidra, jadx, apktool, sqlmap, hashcat, john, ffuf, docker) are set up by setup.sh; the pinned
# toolchain images (ctf-toolkit, ctf-sage:<version>) by `python -m ctf toolchain build` (tools/images.toml).

